{"id":"cae39eab3d6562b6","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-unprovable-formula.md","title":"Unprovable Formula","display":"df-unprovable-formula — Unprovable Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-unprovable-formula","aliases":["89-df-unprovable-formula"],"display":"df-unprovable-formula — Unprovable Formula","depends_on":["[[89-df-provable-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-unprovable-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-unprovable-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-unprovable-formula — Unprovable Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2d52ad4f119b4a14\" href=\"?note=2d52ad4f119b4a14\" title=\"89-df-provable-formula\">89-df-provable-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a recursively axiomatized theory.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d52ad4f119b4a14\" href=\"?note=2d52ad4f119b4a14\" title=\"89-df-provable-formula\">89-df-provable-formula</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unprovable\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnprovFml}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\setminus\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unprovable\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnprovFml}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\setminus\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>不可证明公式在参数理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中没有证明；只有取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T=\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 时才是\nPA 不可证明性</li>\n<li>不可证明公式是 Gödel 句子的特征</li>\n<li>不可证明性是不完备性的核心</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}$ (see [[89-df-provable-formula]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unprovable\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnprovFml}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\setminus\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathrm{PA}","display":false}],"bytes":838,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-373","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-unprovable-formula]]"}],"outgoing":["2d52ad4f119b4a14"]}